<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Ticor Ltd is a diverse mining and engineering group, with investments in titanium pigment manufacture, mineral sands mining and processing and coal mining, 35 percent owned by South African-based still grop Iscor Ltd.  </p>
